      "content": "okay i hear you but i really dont wanna go to the er if i can help it. costs too much and it's a huge hassle. if i just keep it elevated and take some aspirin instead of the ibuprofen, would that be safer to manage the swelling at home until i can call someone in the morning? it doesn't feel like sharp pain or anything, just heavy.",
